- normal: Normal. After the customer is registered and associated, the customer can place orders to purchase cloud resources immediately.', example='Normal'),
      registerNation?: string(name='RegisterNation', description='The country or region of the invited T2 Reseller. The value must comply with the ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 code. You can call the ListCountries operation to query the contract coverage area list of the current UID.

