- 3: immediatelyStop. Immediate shutdown on overdue payment. When the active quota of the customer account is less than 0, the account enters the overdue payment status and instance shutdown is triggered.', example='1'),
    }
  ](name='AccountInfoList', description='The list of account information for the invitation. A maximum of five accounts can be specified at a time.', position='Query'),
